{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.integer_stability","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.integer_stability","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":16,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.integer_stability","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.integer_stability","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/integer_stability.lean#L74-L92","doc":"**Convex-quadratic binding energy** ([`prop:integer-stability`]).\n\nThe binding-energy function `E(p, A)` is a convex quadratic in\n`p`: its leading coefficient `α(A)` is strictly positive. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:integer-stability","label":"prop:integer-stability","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/integer-stability.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.coulombCoeff_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.coulombCoeff_pos","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/integer_stability.lean#L62-L72","doc":"**Coulomb coefficient is positive at `q > 1`**. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.bindingEnergy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.bindingEnergy","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/integer_stability.lean#L58-L60","doc":"The binding-energy function `E(p, A) = α(A)·p² − a_A·p + δ(A)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.alphaCoeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.alphaCoeff","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/integer_stability.lean#L54-L56","doc":"The quadratic-leading coefficient `α(A) = a_C / A^{1/3} + a_A / A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.coulombCoeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.coulombCoeff","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/integer_stability.lean#L49-L52","doc":"The Coulomb coefficient `a_C = (q − q⁻¹) · λ_C`.  Positive at\n`q > 1` since both factors are positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.IntegerStabilityContext.δ_A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.IntegerStabilityContext.δ_A","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/integer_stability.lean#L47-L47","doc":"The intercept `δ(A)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.IntegerStabilityContext.A_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.IntegerStabilityContext.A_pos","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/integer_stability.lean#L45-L45","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.IntegerStabilityContext.A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.IntegerStabilityContext.A","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/integer_stability.lean#L44-L44","doc":"The mass number `A ≥ 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.IntegerStabilityContext.a_A_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.IntegerStabilityContext.a_A_pos","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/integer_stability.lean#L42-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.IntegerStabilityContext.a_A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.IntegerStabilityContext.a_A","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/integer_stability.lean#L41-L41","doc":"Pauli asymmetry coefficient `a_A > 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.IntegerStabilityContext.lam_C_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.IntegerStabilityContext.lam_C_pos","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/integer_stability.lean#L39-L39","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.IntegerStabilityContext.lam_C","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.IntegerStabilityContext.lam_C","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/integer_stability.lean#L38-L38","doc":"Coulomb scale `λ_C > 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.IntegerStabilityContext.q_gt_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.IntegerStabilityContext.q_gt_one","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/integer_stability.lean#L36-L36","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.IntegerStabilityContext.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.IntegerStabilityContext.q","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU